{
    "word": "overwinter",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "f144dc73-379d-3aa8-a935-6edefa64da18",
                "word": "overwinter",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f432073e-9869-3c03-86ac-49ad887611e8",
                        "entry_id": "f144dc73-379d-3aa8-a935-6edefa64da18",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Occurring over the winter season."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "db8d5363-b479-4467-b162-a6b84465b679",
                                "sense_id": "f432073e-9869-3c03-86ac-49ad887611e8",
                                "text": "The effect of seedling size on overwinter injury was analyzed separately by analysis of covariance."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "521ec310-f127-4aa7-900a-dcab2ea98cbe",
                                "sense_id": "f432073e-9869-3c03-86ac-49ad887611e8",
                                "text": "Overwinter survival ranged from 0% to 100% and increased with increasing fall total length and winter temperatures among all cohorts and reservoirs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eddb58b6-a0b7-48d7-b318-c3ce17f69048",
                                "sense_id": "f432073e-9869-3c03-86ac-49ad887611e8",
                                "text": "A replicated site comparison study on 1, 031 agricultural sites across England in 2004–2008 (29) found that in three out of four year-on-year comparisons, grey partridge Perdix perdix density changes and overwinter survival were higher on sites under agri-environment schemes, than on sites not under schemes (density changes were more positive on agri-environment scheme sites than non-agi-environment scheme sites in all comparisons except 2007-2008; overwinter survival was higher for all except 2006-2007)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "cf43052b-645b-3555-9dcb-4f2ce0ff3045",
                "word": "overwinter",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "992f02ba-d391-37a1-9cfe-39a330438c6c",
                        "entry_id": "cf43052b-645b-3555-9dcb-4f2ce0ff3045",
                        "glosses": [
                            "During the winter."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "704aa88d-845d-4500-94f5-841d4e61cf26",
                                "sense_id": "992f02ba-d391-37a1-9cfe-39a330438c6c",
                                "text": "Ground cover of perennial grasses declined seriously under plots covered overwinter with dead thistle plants."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "01c04a72-192a-41b3-8fd6-beb21f6f130c",
                                "sense_id": "992f02ba-d391-37a1-9cfe-39a330438c6c",
                                "text": "Moreover, each year of continuous corn cropping the corn stover would be turned under by fall plowing in preparation for the next spring planting, leaving the land bare overwinter."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "79247404-86cf-4e11-93d4-aca3b17f0f1c",
                                "sense_id": "992f02ba-d391-37a1-9cfe-39a330438c6c",
                                "text": "The copepod Thermocyclops oithonoides rests overwinter as copepodids in lake mud in the Mugglesee and other lakes in Europe."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "532925c8-2312-33b1-a0c6-790ce9ea8fa0",
                "word": "overwinter",
                "pos": "verb",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "6df338c6-30f0-48aa-bec9-c6051e161b99",
                        "entry_id": "532925c8-2312-33b1-a0c6-790ce9ea8fa0",
                        "tags": [
                            "present",
